Syncplay Droid

This product implements protocol behavior derived from and compatible with Syncplay and the
syncplay-noir fork, both distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Syncplay authors and contributors:
- Initial concept and core internals: Uriziel
- GUI design and lead development: Et0h
- Original SyncPlay code: Tomasz Kowalczyk (Fluxid)
- Other Syncplay contributors

This product uses AndroidX Media3 and other AndroidX components, Gson, Kotlin, and kotlinx
coroutines. It also uses SMBJ (com.hierynomus:smbj), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, and LibVLC Android (org.videolan.android:libvlc-all), licensed under the GNU
Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. Their respective licenses and notices
remain applicable.
